# Never commit credentials saved locally per the various *_SETUP.md docs —
# this exact pattern leaked an OpenRouter key into a local commit once
# already (caught by GitHub push protection before it reached the remote,
# but shouldn't have been possible in the first place).
*-api-key.txt
*-key.txt

